# Shell scripts are run by bash on Linux (the AppImage build and
# .github/workflows/linux-appimage.yml). A CRLF checkout breaks them at the first line:
# "build.sh: line 2: set: pipefail: invalid option name". Keep them LF everywhere,
# whatever the contributor's core.autocrlf is.
*.sh text eol=lf
# The AppImage's desktop entry is read by appimagetool and by desktop environments: a trailing
# CR in "Exec=AppRun" would be part of the value.
*.desktop text eol=lf
